\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Deep-Dream separates navigation from factual authority. Derived concepts, observations, assertions, and graph neighborhoods guide candidate generation, but the query path must return to active, scope-valid source spans before submitting evidence. The left schematic illustrates the failure mode in which a compressed fact or graph edge directly becomes answer authority.}}{8}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{8}{Deep-Dream separates navigation from factual authority. Derived concepts, observations, assertions, and graph neighborhoods guide candidate generation, but the query path must return to active, scope-valid source spans before submitting evidence. The left schematic illustrates the failure mode in which a compressed fact or graph edge directly becomes answer authority}{figure.caption.10}{}}
\newlabel{fig:architecture@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][7][]8}{}{}{}}
